## Reading

- P021: 226/384 drops, 179 runs vs 186.98 expected; runs p=0.3998 (permutation 0.4302), lag-1 0.039.
- P023: 52/384 drops, 99 runs vs 90.92 expected; runs p=0.0769 (permutation 0.0940).
